commit edf7d7ce
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 12:19:30 -0600
subject: feat(messages): Messages page P1 — list, detail drawer, conversation tree, export

Implements Phase 1 (View) of the Messages page feature spec
(docs/plans-and-prompts/plans/messages-page-feature-spec.md) — the
"Sentry for LLM requests" view over the existing requestDetails capture.
No new data capture; pure projection over existing rows.

NEW API ROUTES:
- GET /api/messages — list with filters (provider, model, status,
  errorCategory, conversationId, date range) + pagination + lightweight
  conversation grouping (tokens/cost/messageCount per session)
- GET /api/messages/:id — full detail of one captured request
- GET /api/messages/:id/export?format=json|markdown|curl — export in
  three formats (JSON normalized, Markdown transcript, curl snippet with
  auth placeholder)

NEW PAGE /dashboard/messages:
- List view: timestamp, provider/model (resolved names), status badge
  (done/error/partial/cancelled with errorCategory tooltip), tokens,
  latency, conversation id, Detail action; keyset pagination
- Detail drawer: status + info cells (latency/tokens/cost), 5 format
  tabs (Pretty JSON / Raw / Headers / cURL / Markdown) with Copy button
- Conversations view: per-session grouping with message count + token
  totals, expandable per-message rows with status badges
- Filters: conversation ID text, provider dropdown, status dropdown,
  Clear button

Sidebar: new "Messages" nav entry (forum icon) after Usage.

VERIFICATION (production standalone, port 20131, 72 captured messages):
- /api/messages: 5/page, pagination {totalItems:72, totalPages:15}
- /api/messages/:id: full record (request.messages, response, tokens)
- export json/markdown/curl: all three render correctly
- Browser: list renders 50 rows, provider dropdown resolves node names
  (Dialagram Router, MockReal), detail drawer opens with all 5 tabs,
  cURL tab shows reconstructed command, Conversations view groups
  correctly with status badges
- Tray app (cli/app bundle) rebuilt + restarted: /dashboard/messages 200

Spec: plans/messages-page-feature-spec.md (P1 scope)
Research: research/message-capture-* (v1-v4), learnings/2026-08-07-research-synthesis.md
Part of: Messages Page + Error Inbox plan (P1 — View)


